   {
    "title": "Snapstock",
    "description": "• Developed a full-stack application for financial news and historical stock price data that allows users to save stocks to a watch list and follow them over time\n• Worked with multiple third-party APIs to display up-to-date business news and detailed financial data, including data visualizations to display time series data\n• Implemented a Flask server, in addition to the main Node/Express back-end, in order to utilize a python package that scrapes historical stock price data that wasn’t otherwise available\n\nReact | Node.js | PostgreSQL | Flask\n\nFront-end:https://github.com/jonyonson/snapstock-fe\nBack-end: https://github.com/jonyonson/snapstock-be\n",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "May 2020 - May 2020"
   },
   {
    "title": "Digital Wasteland",
    "description": "• Collaborated with a team of four developers to build a game based on the classic text-based, multi-user dungeon games\n• Developed the real-time chat and in-room player awareness capabilities by implementing WebSockets (Pusher.js)\n\nReact | Django | PostgreSQL | WebSockets\n\nhttps://github.com/django-adventure",
